---
// Visual 4-panel anatomy comparing text-over-photo treatments on the same
// mixed-luminance scene (bright sunlit sky + dark mountain cliff):
// 1. Raw text (fails over bright clouds)
// 2. Full flat dark overlay
// 3. Directional bottom-up scrim
// 4. Lower contrast + colorized duotone wash
const uid = Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 8);
const W = 900;
const H = 470;

const panels = [
  { key: 'raw', x: 20, y: 20 },
  { key: 'overlay', x: 460, y: 20 },
  { key: 'scrim', x: 20, y: 245 },
  { key: 'duotone', x: 460, y: 245 },
];
---
<figure class="img-scrim">
  <div class="img-scrim-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Four-panel comparison of white text over a high-contrast mountain photograph: raw text fails over bright clouds, flat dark overlay dims the whole photo, directional bottom-up scrim keeps the sky bright, and colorized duotone creates a cohesive brand backdrop.">
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id={`sky-${uid}`} x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
          <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#8bb8e8" />
          <stop offset="60%" stop-color="#e8eef5" />
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#f7f5ee" />
        </linearGradient>
        <linearGradient id={`sky-mono-${uid}`} x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
          <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#64748b" />
          <stop offset="60%" stop-color="#94a3b8" />
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#cbd5e1" />
        </linearGradient>
        <linearGradient id={`dir-scrim-${uid}`} x1="0" y1="1" x2="0" y2="0">
          <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#0f172a" stop-opacity="0.82" />
          <stop offset="52%" stop-color="#0f172a" stop-opacity="0.45" />
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#0f172a" stop-opacity="0" />
        </linearGradient>
        {panels.map((p) => (
          <clipPath id={`clip-${p.key}-${uid}`}>
            <rect x="0" y="0" width="400" height="148" rx="6" />
          </clipPath>
        ))}
      </defs>

      {/* Panel 1: Raw text (Bad) */}
      <g transform="translate(20, 16)">
        <text x="0" y="16" class="img-scrim-title is-bad">
          <tspan data-lang-en>1. Raw text over photo (fails WCAG: 1.2:1)</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Chữ trực tiếp trên ảnh (trượt WCAG: 1,2:1)</tspan>
        </text>
        <g transform="translate(0, 26)">
          <g clip-path={`url(#clip-raw-${uid})`}>
            <rect width="400" height="148" fill={`url(#sky-${uid})`} />
            <ellipse cx="105" cy="96" rx="125" ry="34" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.92" />
            <polygon points="0,124 85,54 170,118 250,48 345,112 400,72 400,148 0,148" fill="#cbd5e1" />
            <polygon points="0,124 85,54 135,148 0,148" fill="#f1f5f9" />
            <polygon points="250,48 310,148 180,148" fill="#1e293b" />
            <polygon points="155,148 280,96 400,128 400,148" fill="#0f172a" />
            {/* White headline spanning bright snow (left) and dark cliff (right) */}
            <text x="16" y="114" class="img-scrim-photo-h">
              <tspan data-lang-en>Sunrise ridge route</tspan>
              <tspan data-lang-vi>Cung đường đón bình minh</tspan>
            </text>
            <text x="16" y="134" class="img-scrim-photo-sub">
              <tspan data-lang-en>Left words vanish into bright snow.</tspan>
              <tspan data-lang-vi>Chữ bên trái biến mất vào nền sáng.</tspan>
            </text>
          </g>
          <rect x="0" y="0" width="400" height="148" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="var(--red)" stroke-width="1.6" />
        </g>
        <text x="0" y="194" class="img-scrim-note">
          <tspan data-lang-en>High luminance variance breaks white and black text alike.</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Độ sáng chênh lệch gắt làm hỏng cả chữ trắng lẫn chữ đen.</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>

      {/* Panel 2: Full dark overlay */}
      <g transform="translate(460, 16)">
        <text x="0" y="16" class="img-scrim-title">
          <tspan data-lang-en>2. Flat dark overlay (6.4:1 everywhere)</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Lớp phủ tối đều (6,4:1 khắp ảnh)</tspan>
        </text>
        <g transform="translate(0, 26)">
          <g clip-path={`url(#clip-overlay-${uid})`}>
            <rect width="400" height="148" fill={`url(#sky-${uid})`} />
            <ellipse cx="105" cy="96" rx="125" ry="34" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.92" />
            <polygon points="0,124 85,54 170,118 250,48 345,112 400,72 400,148 0,148" fill="#cbd5e1" />
            <polygon points="0,124 85,54 135,148 0,148" fill="#f1f5f9" />
            <polygon points="250,48 310,148 180,148" fill="#1e293b" />
            <polygon points="155,148 280,96 400,128 400,148" fill="#0f172a" />
            {/* Uniform 52% dark wash */}
            <rect width="400" height="148" fill="#0f172a" opacity="0.54" />
            <text x="16" y="114" class="img-scrim-photo-h">
              <tspan data-lang-en>Sunrise ridge route</tspan>
              <tspan data-lang-vi>Cung đường đón bình minh</tspan>
            </text>
            <text x="16" y="134" class="img-scrim-photo-sub">
              <tspan data-lang-en>Safe for centered hero text; dims upper sky.</tspan>
              <tspan data-lang-vi>An toàn cho chữ căn giữa; trời phía trên bị tối.</tspan>
            </text>
          </g>
          <rect x="0" y="0" width="400" height="148" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1.2" />
        </g>
        <text x="0" y="194" class="img-scrim-note">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Even legibility across the whole frame, slightly muted mood.</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Đọc rõ đều mọi vị trí, đổi lại cả ảnh trầm xuống.</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>

      {/* Panel 3: Directional bottom-up scrim */}
      <g transform="translate(20, 240)">
        <text x="0" y="16" class="img-scrim-title">
          <tspan data-lang-en>3. Directional bottom-up scrim (7.8:1 in text zone)</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>3. Scrim chuyển sắc từ đáy lên (7,8:1 tại vùng chữ)</tspan>
        </text>
        <g transform="translate(0, 26)">
          <g clip-path={`url(#clip-scrim-${uid})`}>
            <rect width="400" height="148" fill={`url(#sky-${uid})`} />
            <ellipse cx="105" cy="96" rx="125" ry="34" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.92" />
            <polygon points="0,124 85,54 170,118 250,48 345,112 400,72 400,148 0,148" fill="#cbd5e1" />
            <polygon points="0,124 85,54 135,148 0,148" fill="#f1f5f9" />
            <polygon points="250,48 310,148 180,148" fill="#1e293b" />
            <polygon points="155,148 280,96 400,128 400,148" fill="#0f172a" />
            {/* Directional scrim */}
            <rect width="400" height="148" fill={`url(#dir-scrim-${uid})`} />
            <text x="16" y="114" class="img-scrim-photo-h">
              <tspan data-lang-en>Sunrise ridge route</tspan>
              <tspan data-lang-vi>Cung đường đón bình minh</tspan>
            </text>
            <text x="16" y="134" class="img-scrim-photo-sub">
              <tspan data-lang-en>Sky stays bright; only the text zone darkens.</tspan>
              <tspan data-lang-vi>Bầu trời giữ nguyên độ sáng; chỉ vùng chữ tối đi.</tspan>
            </text>
          </g>
          <rect x="0" y="0" width="400" height="148" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1.2" />
        </g>
        <text x="0" y="194" class="img-scrim-note">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Best default for cards and banners with anchored copy.</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Lựa chọn mặc định tốt nhất cho thẻ và banner đặt chữ ở đáy.</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>

      {/* Panel 4: Lower contrast + colorize duotone */}
      <g transform="translate(460, 240)">
        <text x="0" y="16" class="img-scrim-title">
          <tspan data-lang-en>4. Lower contrast + brand duotone (6.9:1)</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>4. Giảm tương phản + nhuộm màu thương hiệu (6,9:1)</tspan>
        </text>
        <g transform="translate(0, 26)">
          <g clip-path={`url(#clip-duotone-${uid})`}>
            {/* Flattened monochrome photo */}
            <rect width="400" height="148" fill={`url(#sky-mono-${uid})`} />
            <ellipse cx="105" cy="96" rx="125" ry="34" fill="#cbd5e1" opacity="0.6" />
            <polygon points="0,124 85,54 170,118 250,48 345,112 400,72 400,148 0,148" fill="#64748b" />
            <polygon points="0,124 85,54 135,148 0,148" fill="#94a3b8" />
            <polygon points="250,48 310,148 180,148" fill="#334155" />
            <polygon points="155,148 280,96 400,128 400,148" fill="#1e293b" />
            {/* Brand hue wash */}
            <rect width="400" height="148" fill="#1e3a5f" opacity="0.62" />
            <text x="16" y="114" class="img-scrim-photo-h">
              <tspan data-lang-en>Sunrise ridge route</tspan>
              <tspan data-lang-vi>Cung đường đón bình minh</tspan>
            </text>
            <text x="16" y="134" class="img-scrim-photo-sub">
              <tspan data-lang-en>Turns noisy photos into calm brand textures.</tspan>
              <tspan data-lang-vi>Biến ảnh rối mắt thành nền thương hiệu êm dịu.</tspan>
            </text>
          </g>
          <rect x="0" y="0" width="400" height="148" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1.2" />
        </g>
        <text x="0" y="194" class="img-scrim-note">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Trades natural colors for uniform SaaS section cohesion.</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Đổi màu tự nhiên lấy sự đồng bộ cho banner và header phụ.</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Four ways to handle white text on the exact same high-contrast scene. Illustrative contrast ratios measured against the brightest pixel behind the headline.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Bốn cách xử lý chữ trắng trên cùng một khung cảnh tương phản mạnh. Tỷ lệ tương phản minh họa được đo tại điểm sáng nhất ngay sau dòng tiêu đề.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .img-scrim { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .img-scrim-scroll { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
  .img-scrim svg { min-width: 640px; width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; font-family: inherit; }
  .img-scrim-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .img-scrim-title.is-bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .img-scrim-photo-h { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; fill: #ffffff; }
  .img-scrim-photo-sub { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 500; fill: #f8fafc; opacity: 0.94; }
  .img-scrim-note { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .img-scrim figcaption { margin-top: 0.75em; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
